# Janice Rand, Essential Aide: "Whenever a commander you control enters or attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on it, then reveal cards
# from the top of your library until you reveal a land card. Put that card onto the battlefield tapped and the rest on the bottom
# of your library in a random order." Janice is Bot1's commander and is cast from the command zone on turn 1 ({3}{G} from Black
# Lotus and a Mox Emerald): entering is the first trigger, so she becomes a 4/4 (CR 603.6a, 122.1) and the Forest on top of the
# library enters tapped (CR 701.20, 401.4). She attacks on turn 3: a second counter makes her 5/5, the Island now on top enters
# tapped, and she deals 5.

